<!-- ============ 06 — DECISIONS ============ -->
<section id="s06" class="sec" data-toc="Decisions">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="sh"><div class="sh-row"><span class="sh-n">06</span><span class="sh-rule"><i></i></span><span class="sh-tag">Decisions</span></div><h2 class="sh-t">Key design <em>decisions</em></h2><p class="sh-s">Three calls that set MediKare apart from a typical self-service kiosk.</p></header>
    <div class="dec reveal">
      <div><svg class="vig dv" viewBox="0 0 220 96" aria-hidden="true"><g stroke="#111" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round">
   <path d="M20 90 H200"/><rect x="104" y="50" width="10" height="40" fill="#4A4E55"/><rect x="92" y="20" width="34" height="32" rx="4" fill="#2A2C31"/><rect class="scr" x="96" y="24" width="26" height="24" rx="2" fill="#DCE8F6" stroke="none"/>
   <circle cx="66" cy="44" r="6" fill="#C28B5E"/><path d="M57 90 Q57 55 66 54 Q75 55 75 90 Z" fill="#EDA100"/><path class="tap" d="M72 62 L92 46" fill="none" stroke-width="2.2"/>
   <circle cx="154" cy="42" r="6" fill="#8C5A3C"/><path d="M144 90 Q145 53 154 52 Q163 53 164 90 Z" fill="#E87BA4"/><path class="wave" d="M128 46 L146 60" fill="none" stroke-width="2.2"/>
   <circle class="dot" style="animation-delay:0s" cx="166" cy="24" r="2.4" fill="#074D9E" stroke="none"/><circle class="dot" style="animation-delay:.2s" cx="174" cy="24" r="2.4" fill="#074D9E" stroke="none"/><circle class="dot" style="animation-delay:.4s" cx="182" cy="24" r="2.4" fill="#074D9E" stroke="none"/>
 </g><text x="44" y="12">patient</text><text x="140" y="12">health worker</text></svg><span class="k">Decision 01</span><h4>Human-in-the-loop service model</h4><p class="dsum">A health worker stays at the kiosk to guide every visit.</p><p>A health worker stays at the kiosk to guide each visit. It costs a person per kiosk, but it is what both personas needed to trust the machine.</p><p class="why"><span class="wk">Why:</span> 31.7% of patients were unsure about a doctor on a screen.</p><div class="vs"><div><span>Typical kiosk</span>Unattended, self-service</div><div><span>MediKare</span>ASHA worker or local assistant on hand</div></div></div>
      <div><svg class="vig dv" viewBox="0 0 220 96" aria-hidden="true"><g stroke="#111" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linejoin="round">
   <rect class="key" style="animation-delay:0.00s" x="24" y="18" width="16" height="14" rx="3" fill="#fff"/><rect class="key" style="animation-delay:0.35s" x="46" y="18" width="16" height="14" rx="3" fill="#fff"/><rect class="key" style="animation-delay:0.70s" x="68" y="18" width="16" height="14" rx="3" fill="#fff"/><rect class="key" style="animation-delay:1.05s" x="24" y="38" width="16" height="14" rx="3" fill="#fff"/><rect class="key" style="animation-delay:1.40s" x="46" y="38" width="16" height="14" rx="3" fill="#fff"/><rect class="key" style="animation-delay:1.75s" x="68" y="38" width="16" height="14" rx="3" fill="#fff"/><rect class="key" style="animation-delay:2.10s" x="24" y="58" width="16" height="14" rx="3" fill="#fff"/><rect class="key" style="animation-delay:2.45s" x="46" y="58" width="16" height="14" rx="3" fill="#fff"/><rect class="key" style="animation-delay:2.80s" x="68" y="58" width="16" height="14" rx="3" fill="#fff"/>
   <circle cx="162" cy="48" r="26" fill="#fff"/><circle cx="162" cy="42" r="8" fill="none"/><path d="M148 66 Q162 52 176 66" fill="none"/>
   <rect class="scan" x="140" y="26" width="44" height="2.5" rx="1" fill="#5FD4FF" stroke="none"/>
   <g class="tick"><circle cx="184" cy="26" r="9" fill="#1BAF7A" stroke="#fff"/><path d="M180 26 l3 3 l5 -6" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2"/></g>
 </g><text x="101" y="52">or</text><text x="30" y="92">keypad</text><text x="142" y="92">face scan</text></svg><span class="k">Decision 02</span><h4>Dual-path, low-literacy authentication</h4><p class="dsum">Sign in with a phone number or a guided face scan. No forms, no passwords.</p><p>A phone number on a large keypad, or a face scan that guides each step. No forms, no passwords.</p><p class="why"><span class="wk">Why:</span> 21.4% of patients studied to class 5 or less.</p><div class="vs"><div><span>Typical login</span>Typed IDs and passwords</div><div><span>MediKare</span>Phone number + face scan</div></div></div>
      <div><svg class="vig dv" viewBox="0 0 220 96" aria-hidden="true"><g stroke="#111" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round">
   <rect x="26" y="14" width="56" height="40" rx="5" fill="#2A2C31"/><rect x="31" y="19" width="46" height="30" rx="2" fill="#DCE8F6" stroke="none"/><path d="M36 60 H72"/>
   <g class="paper"><rect x="42" y="60" width="24" height="28" fill="#fff"/><path d="M47 68 H61 M47 74 H58 M47 80 H60" stroke-width="1.1"/></g>
   <rect x="162" y="16" width="34" height="64" rx="6" fill="#fff"/><path d="M174 74 H184"/>
   <g class="sms"><rect x="84" y="22" width="26" height="14" rx="4" fill="#E8EFF8"/><path d="M89 29 H105" stroke-width="1.1"/></g>
   <circle class="ping" cx="179" cy="40" r="10" fill="none" stroke="#1BAF7A" stroke-width="2"/>
 </g><text x="40" y="96">print</text><text x="166" y="96">SMS</text></svg><span class="k">Decision 03</span><h4>Multichannel prescription delivery</h4><p class="dsum">The prescription prints at the kiosk or arrives by SMS, with optional reminders.</p><p>The prescription prints at the kiosk or arrives by SMS, with optional reminders. A printer adds hardware, but a phone can’t be assumed.</p><p class="why"><span class="wk">Why:</span> 5 of 11 doctors wanted a printed prescription.</p><div class="vs"><div><span>Typical telehealth</span>Prescription in an app</div><div><span>MediKare</span>Print or SMS, user decides</div></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

